        "story_p3": "Then I got my testosterone tested — and everything made sense.",
        "story_p4": "I went all-in on understanding what actually moves the needle for male hormones, naturally.",
        "tried_title": "I TRIED EVERYTHING:",
        "tried_list": "More caffeine|Generic multivitamins|Random T-boosters|Crash diets|Cold showers|Sleep hacks|Expensive clinics|And more",
